ext": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:      Yeah! Is this yours? This comic book?\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:      Yes. Do you like comic books?", "time": "8300", "id": 2}, {"image": "engenn2le03ob05re2img05.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:      Mmm, not really ... I like to read magazines. What do you like to read?\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:      Well, comic books and the paper.", "time": "17000", "id": 3}, {"image": "engenn2le03ob05re2img01.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:      I like to shop! Do you?\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:      Mmm ... I'm not looking for anything right now. What's your favorite shop?", "time": "28000", "id": 4}, {"image": "engenn2le03ob05re2img01.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:      Any shop at the mall! I collect shoes.\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:   Hah! My sister collects shoes too. I collect comic books. I have a lot at home! Oh. Is this your bag?", "time": "38000", "id": 5}, {"image": "engenn2le03ob05re2img02.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:      No, it's not mine. It's hers.\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:      Excuse me. Is this your bag?\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Woman</span>:       Oh yes, it is. Thank you very much.", "time": "52000", "id": 6}]}}], "id": 1}], "type": "scholar", "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}]}], "id": 0}], "_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"content": "At the Coffee Shop", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "I Love This!", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 5, "type": "position"}, {"content": "scholar > How to Master Small Talk > Meeting Electra", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 3, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "A1.1", "type": "level"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"content": "Accurately use information about free-time activities or personal likes/dislikes in communicative situations. ", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Understands simple information in slow conversations about the communicative topics and vocabulary related to this level.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Understands simple information in slow conversations about the communicative topics and vocabulary related to this level.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Understands simple information in slow conversations about the communicative topics and vocabulary related to this level.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Understands key information  in written texts about the communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Understands key information  in written texts about the communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Understands simple information in slow conversations about the communicative topics and vocabulary related to this level.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Understands simple information in slow conversations about the communicative topics and vocabulary related to this level.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Understands simple information in slow conversations about the communicative topics and vocabulary related to this level.", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Possessive Pronouns", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use possessive pronouns to talk about things that belong to someone. Possessive pronouns can take the place of nouns.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "This coffee is my coffee.  ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "This coffee is mine. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "This bag is not mine. It is hers. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "That computer is yours.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Compare possessive adjectives and pronouns in this chart:", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":\"07\",\"columns\":\"03\",\"cells\":[\"\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Possessive Adjectives </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Possessive Pronouns </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"It's my juice.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"It's mine.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"You\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"That's your coffee.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"That coffee is yours.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"He\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"It's his computer.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"The computer is his.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"She\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"It's her bag. \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"The bag is hers.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"We\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Those are our books.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Those books are ours.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"They\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"It's their car.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"The car is theirs.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "The Present Continuous Tense in the Negative", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You make the Present Continuous tense negative by adding <span class=\"strong\"> not</span> after the verb <span class=\"strong\">to be</span> and before the <span class=\"strong\">verb-ing</span>.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "I am not looking for anything right now. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "You can also use a contracted form like <span class=\"italic\">isn't</span>.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "He is not eating dinner.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "She isn't playing video games.", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "comic book  ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a book of pictures that tell a story ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun) ", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I like to read comic books.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn2le03ob05aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": " These are words you hear in conversations about likes and dislikes.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "magazine ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a thin book with articles and pictures", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)  ", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I like to read magazines. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn2le03ob05aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "paper   ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "short form of \"newspaper\"", "type": "definition"}, {"content": " (noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I read the paper every morning.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn2le03ob05aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to shop ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to look for and buy things ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)  ", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I like  to shop! ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn2le03ob05aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "shop  ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a place to buy things ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun) ", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: My favorite shop is the bookstore.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn2le03ob05aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "mall ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a large building with many stores and restaurants ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)  ", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I like to go to the mall to shop.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn2le03ob05aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to collect   ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to bring together things from different places ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I collect superhero comic books.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn2le03ob05aud07", "type": "audio"}]}, {"content": "engenn2le03ob05re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Ask about a friend's hobbies.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Ask them about what they like.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Ask them about what they dislike.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Share your answers with your class.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I ask about a friend's hobbies.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I write about my friend's likes and dislikes.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I share the answers with the class.", "type": "text"}]}]}